Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相就是 我已经无药可救\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is… I'm past saving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.33,0:00:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我会有什么样的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how my story ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾是害怕的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been the one out there scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.25,0:00:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 他拼尽全力救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Dean… - He did whatever he could to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我欠他的 我欠他一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe him this. I owe him everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:16.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（走过的路）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.05,0:00:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 母亲 - 你会帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mother. - Will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.61,0:00:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要救我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saving my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉你哥哥我们在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell your brother what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她破解了密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's cracked the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.97,0:00:30.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（匹配）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝把黑暗锁了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}God locked the darkness away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.19,0:00:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他创造了一个血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he created a mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.11,0:01:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印既是锁也是钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would serve as both lock and key,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印不能解除\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark cannot be relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.03,0:01:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则黑暗会被释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}lest the darkness be set free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:22.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.38,0:01:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.37,0:02:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.63,0:03:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:03:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边一英里处\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a mile that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.79,0:03:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗来袭 你不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The… the darkness hit. You disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不记得了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember none of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.60,0:04:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.56,0:04:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.76,0:04:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第11季第1集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.84,0:05:01.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（胡安妮塔餐馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second, what…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.61,0:05:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫 她救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, she saved you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.29,0:05:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看到了 黑云来袭时 一片黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were there. When the storm hit, everything went dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.29,0:05:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你从车里消失了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you just disappeared from the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不记得这段\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得有什么女人把你弄出去了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't remember some woman pulling you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you want me to say, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.09,0:05:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来在车里 然后就突然出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in the car, and then I wasn't in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站在地里 她也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in the field, and she was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她告诉你她就是黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she told you she was the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她戴名牌了 你以为呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. She was wearing a nametag. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她感谢了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thanked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Setting her free.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你 是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't set her free. I set her free.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你念的咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, yeah, you said the spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.34,0:05:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但血印是在我身上 锁和钥匙嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I had the mark, so lock and key.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 她还觉得欠你人情了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, now she feels indebted to you or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 她可是黑暗啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. She's the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就只说了谢谢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's all she said? Thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 她怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. She was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有种气场 一种专注感\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she had this energy about her, this… this focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.35,0:05:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过话不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, yeah, not a talker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们是屁都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we know Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道她的样貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we know what she looks like,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.97,0:05:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还知道她不是好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we know that she's evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:05:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 她知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, what does she know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:06:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从时间之初就被关起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she's been locked away since the beginning of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.27,0:06:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道什么是芝士汉堡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she even know what a cheeseburger is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.14,0:06:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道是我们放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that we set her free,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.34,0:06:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就得把她关回去 不管付出什么代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna put her back in, no matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.86,0:06:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.86,0:06:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不拦我上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just gonna let me get in the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你风风火火的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were on a roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你杀得了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You execrable…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.24,0:07:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:07:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制不住 你得赶紧逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help myself. You have to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.85,0:09:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.14,0:09:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.07,0:09:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a happy sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.63,0:09:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 伙计 别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, easy, buddy. Just stay cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,先让我们搞清是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}till we figure out what's going here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别逼我哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of narrowing my options here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道他是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know what he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.40,0:10:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器放在地上 慢慢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons on the ground. Slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是联调局的 我们有警徽\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're FBI, okay? We got badges.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.61,0:10:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,露出皮肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me some skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.91,0:10:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想看脱衣舞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this, like, a "Magic Mike" moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your throats!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you think we're… we're…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.50,0:10:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道他们怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know what these are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.57,0:10:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道你们跟他们不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know you're not one of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.33,0:10:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是什么 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One of what? - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 看吧 看到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right, look. Huh? See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿证件吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see those ids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你悠着点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Take… take it easy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏人干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,钢筋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想找掩护 摔倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sought cover. I fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.47,0:10:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 跟我们讲讲这里发生了什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Why don't you tell us what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,911接警 一家人受困\N{\fnArial\fs30}911 reported a family in distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.17,0:10:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赶到时看到多个行凶者袭击这一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I arrived to find several hostiles attacking said family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god, it was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干多久了 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you been on the job, deputy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.08,0:10:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,三周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.06,0:10:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迪恩 这是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean. This is Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just breathe. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.42,0:11:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,说白话 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak plain. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.07,0:11:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把一家人都杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,道路维修工 像一群疯狗一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Road crew. It was… they were like rabid dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发了警告枪 但他们不肯停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fired off a warning, but they didn't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.81,0:11:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们 - 你杀了他们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They… - You killed all these?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识其中几个 但他们看起来不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew some of the boys, but they didn't look…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不对劲 他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something was wrong. They were…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我可以给你缝一下 但会很疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, I can stitch that up, but, uh, it's gonna be ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.03,0:11:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近有医院吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a hospital around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,往前走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.01,0:11:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.85,0:11:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is encouraging.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:11:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really know what to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.59,0:12:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know what to expect in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以还是什么都带上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm just gonna chuck it all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.30,0:12:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定是黑暗干的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the darkness, right? It's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.74,0:12:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 她一来 大家就变疯狂僵尸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, she shows up and everybody goes "28 days later"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.92,0:12:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就没有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.72,0:12:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我坐在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I was in the car,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.74,0:12:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你说她保护了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you were… you said she protected you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.05,0:12:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许不是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe it wasn't her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是烟的关系 所有暴露在外的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it was the smoke, and anybody who was outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,像道路维修工 就受到了影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the road crew, they were exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.73,0:12:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看到了 他们不是人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you saw that. That wasn't human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.75,0:12:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 烟把他们变异了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? The smoke mutated 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 有何不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时前我刚杀了死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a couple hours ago, I killed death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在什么都能接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty much open for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.43,0:12:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但变成什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mutated into what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 一件一件来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you know what, one thing at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.28,0:12:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先处理她的伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get her some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.11,0:12:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再应付后面遇到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we'll deal with whatever comes next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.99,0:12:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得汇报情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to call this in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 再来人 只会死更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, bad idea. More people, more bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.39,0:12:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll deal with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.65,0:12:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 迪恩 我到处去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Dean, I'm gonna take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给她缝针\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sew her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.62,0:12:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你熟悉这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You know this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.22,0:13:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边走 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This way. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,会很疼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna hurt like a son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识那些人的姐妹 父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew those boys' sisters, their parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.81,0:14:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不过是履行了职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did what you were trained to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.65,0:14:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人训练我打死朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't train you to shoot your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.67,0:14:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我慌了 我本可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I panicked. I could have…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经不是人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those boys weren't boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是怪物了 是威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were monsters, and they were a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.84,0:14:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都会慌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody could have panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是每个人都能做到你做到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anybody could have done what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.93,0:14:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份工作本该是拯救生命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This job is supposed to be saving people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.72,0:14:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.17,0:14:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上说起来好听多了是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds better on paper, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.02,0:15:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你道过谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now that you've said your thanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.17,0:15:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈接下来会如何吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's talk about what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.14,0:15:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.25,0:15:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久没觉得这么平静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't felt this peaceful in a long, long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's get something straight…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.77,0:15:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来给你平静的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to bring you peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.74,0:15:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.33,0:15:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走了那么久 我以为没人记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been gone so long, I didn't think anyone remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.97,0:15:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡把你说得绘声绘色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, death painted a hell of a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识什么死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know this death,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.07,0:15:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he doesn't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我不该马上杀了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, are you saying I shouldn't try and kill you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.87,0:15:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.59,0:16:21.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（清洁工）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.48,0:16:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.31,0:16:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.48,0:16:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以出来了 我是联调局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay to come out. I'm, uh, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:16:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.87,0:16:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我的警徽从门下滑进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna slide my badge under the door, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.90,0:17:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:17:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就用老办法吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old-school it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,香草薰油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vanilla spice?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.99,0:18:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛恩 我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marn? Down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.35,0:18:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐好就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just sit your tush down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me get this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.11,0:18:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在考虑你说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking a lot about what you said…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.74,0:18:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 你说出来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and… and I know, I lost my chickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you put it out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但毕竟你妻子跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not every day that your wife tells you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.85,0:18:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想看你搞你好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she wants to watch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.75,0:18:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是天天都有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}get a party started with your best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我考虑了一下 还祈祷了一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I slept on it and I prayed on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我想到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then it came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,YOLO\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.19,0:18:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yolo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生只有一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You only live once."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.30,0:18:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别做那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.86,0:18:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我打给了戴尔 他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I called Dale, and he said…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.31,0:19:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-e-double-hockey-sticks, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔跟黛比商量了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale ran it by Deb…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本来只打算去吃自助的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were only gonna get buffet anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.18,0:19:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到我会这么紧张 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think I'd be this nervous, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.39,0:19:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 我们会很温柔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. We'll be gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 才不会呢 - 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not! - Oh, Dale!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.52,0:19:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 今天是你的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhoo, it's your day, birthday girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.19,0:19:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说开始 我们就搞起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just say go, and, heck… we will light this candle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.91,0:19:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛恩 车没问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marn? Everything okay with the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.74,0:19:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:35.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纳克尔斯郡医疗中心）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.85,0:19:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生说生产会不太轻松 但詹妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doc said it was gonna be a tough birth, but Janie…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.98,0:19:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}…She stepped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.48,0:19:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙卷风袭来 停电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The twister hit, the power went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还继续了下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just kept on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.70,0:19:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没打麻药\N{\fnArial\fs30}No drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.16,0:19:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫不畏缩地把这小东西推出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just pushed out this little dewdrop like she was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后詹妮开始流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Janie started bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.55,0:20:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tried, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,按理说他们该知道如何止血才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd think they'd know how to stop something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能跟我们说说这里发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you could tell us what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之后走了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went outside, after.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,想镇定下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.95,0:20:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一车人下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A truckload of 'em pulled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.65,0:20:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,道路维修工吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The road crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't say nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just went off,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.41,0:20:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是着了魔一样到处袭击人\N{\fnArial\fs30}attacking folks like they were possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.01,0:20:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我冲回去救孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tore back inside to get this little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了那个储藏室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found that supply closet,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.98,0:20:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就一直待在里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know, been there since.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我能听到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could hear them, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tearing through the halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.88,0:20:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 护士 他们根本不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctors, nurses… they didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说道路维修工发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said the road crew went nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.08,0:21:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没来找你麻烦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did any of them come after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a few of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.15,0:21:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们切伤你了吗 或者把血滴在你身上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they cut you or bleed on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.48,0:21:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.50,0:21:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.54,0:21:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying that whatever this is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是会传染的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it might be transmittable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我们都不知道这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? We don't even know what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.10,0:21:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还说它能传播\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're saying it can be passed on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.51,0:21:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.29,0:21:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.94,0:21:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在发生变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.57,0:21:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受袭到现在多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has it been since you were attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,三四个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.24,0:21:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过多久我也会变成他们那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}how long till I become like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.41,0:22:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟们 姐妹们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brothers, sisters…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.18,0:22:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我没这个权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I have no right,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.56,0:22:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有资格求你们任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no standing to ask you… you anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.86,0:22:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但情况危急 我必须求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but these are desperate times, so ask I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.14,0:22:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忏悔我的过错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I confess my transgressions,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.95,0:22:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿接受你们的任何惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will accept whatever punishment you dole out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.61,0:22:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.08,0:22:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.51,0:22:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.24,0:22:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我做出更可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save me from doing worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.25,0:23:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know where I stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.75,0:23:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.77,0:23:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是认真的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.82,0:23:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他出去 会被他们杀了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he goes out there, they'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.31,0:23:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就等着他杀我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we just wait around for him to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.39,0:23:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这是个好计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, that's… that's a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.09,0:23:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我们等着他死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we just wait for him to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.80,0:23:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前有个…随你怎么叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a… whatever you want to call it…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.65,0:23:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯子 在袭击储藏室门\N{\fnArial\fs30}a "rabid" attacking the closet door,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.15,0:23:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他突然死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he just died.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.03,0:23:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西寿命很短的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things have a shelf life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.95,0:23:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe what I'm hearing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.38,0:23:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把他关起来 去找解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lock him up, we find a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.19,0:23:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是间医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.15,0:23:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是直觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, call it a hunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.25,0:23:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得这毛病医书里不会有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't think you're gonna find this in the medical books.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.27,0:23:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打开储藏室的门不是想找解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't open up that closet door to find a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.12,0:23:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 很抱歉 但这是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Mike, I'm sorry, but this is untenable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.43,0:23:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.84,0:23:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以或许我们可以做个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I thought maybe we could make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.42,0:23:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.40,0:24:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个安静的地方 待到一切结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}find somewhere quiet and lay low until this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.04,0:24:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you save my baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.56,0:24:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.68,0:24:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,说定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got yourself a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.88,0:24:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thank you for that. I truly do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.76,0:24:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不是在跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wasn't talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.84,0:24:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.57,0:24:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是个孩子时 我就在教堂见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen you in church since you were knee-high.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.21,0:24:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.15,0:24:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连豚鼠都没养过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even own a guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.71,0:24:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.95,0:24:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.70,0:24:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.64,0:24:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.10,0:24:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I get the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.85,0:24:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头我们会好心没好报\N{\fnArial\fs30}that that is gonna bite us in the ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.00,0:24:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.35,0:24:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Aces.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.04,0:25:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 拿上装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's gear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.30,0:25:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不好办\N{\fnArial\fs30}That might be tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.51,0:25:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.45,0:25:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 我们做出了承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean… - We made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.87,0:25:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么 带着枪冲出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do what? Charge out there, guns blazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.14,0:25:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道怎么杀掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know how to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.10,0:25:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道 打胸部 是吧 我猜是心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does. Chest, right? I'm guessing heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.05,0:25:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.15,0:25:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那才叫疯狂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, that is madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.54,0:25:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is horse sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.64,0:26:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救迈克的孩子 但打死迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save Mike's baby, but shoot Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.10,0:26:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.30,0:26:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以等着他们死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can just wait for them to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.09,0:26:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how long is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.51,0:26:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们感染了别人又要等多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when they infect others, how long is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.89,0:26:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们留在这儿 孩子必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we stay here, that baby dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.40,0:26:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的错 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did this, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.26,0:26:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.34,0:26:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们闯的祸 我们兜着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We broke it, we bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.36,0:26:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道没别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.16,0:26:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小子去哪了 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are you, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.78,0:26:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.91,0:26:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听上去不像没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't sound okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.39,0:26:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I am fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.39,0:26:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 你也解决不了我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, what I have, you can't help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.38,0:26:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, what you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.79,0:26:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just please tell Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.43,0:26:49.54,Title,0,0,0,0,,罗威娜拿着《诅咒之书》和法典逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena escaped with The Book of the Damned and the codex.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.55,0:26:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 别管罗威娜了 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, forget Rowena. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.15,0:26:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you tell me… the mark…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.24,0:26:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 发生这么多 你还担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really? You're worried about me after everything…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.83,0:26:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 去掉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, is it gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.65,0:27:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.01,0:27:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm not great.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.65,0:27:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.25,0:27:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.36,0:27:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.37,0:27:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.70,0:27:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 该你了 跟我们说说黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, your turn. Talk to us about the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.16,0:27:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要说黑暗的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I talk about the darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.91,0:27:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它被释放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.72,0:27:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.41,0:27:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,移除血印打开了一个锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Removing the mark opened some kind of lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.75,0:27:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩看到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.96,0:27:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗是个女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The darkness is a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.47,0:27:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们问的就是这个啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's what we're asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.60,0:27:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还指望你能说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were hoping you could tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.41,0:27:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是多糟的情况呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}what kind of Defcon screwed we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.90,0:27:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.65,0:27:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.65,0:27:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.43,0:27:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能有一阵子不会再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may be some time before we see one another again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.86,0:27:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 小卡 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Cass. Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.25,0:27:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.69,0:27:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.19,0:28:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可真够慢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.17,0:28:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,您一召唤我们就尽快赶来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came as soon as you called.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.32,0:28:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么称呼您\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.01,0:28:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}King.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.73,0:28:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个白人肉身呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the other white meatsuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.67,0:28:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很安全 有另一组人和一个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secured. We have another team and a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.64,0:28:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在移除罗威娜的固定咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}removing Rowena's immobilization spell as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.29,0:28:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人觉得热吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.13,0:28:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我热死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.95,0:28:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是更年期的关系 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that's the menopause, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.82,0:28:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢你提醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.16,0:28:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.74,0:28:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's nothing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.06,0:28:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.22,0:28:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是 您险些被暗杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just, you barely escaped assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.68,0:29:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,您算是正在躲避世上最强大的女巫的追杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're arguably on the run from the most powerful witch on earth …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.31,0:29:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别说还有个天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention an angel of heaven…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.59,0:29:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.95,0:29:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,您居然等群交完了才召唤我们帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you didn't call for help until after the orgy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.34,0:29:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我道歉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.05,0:29:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.67,0:29:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我明白 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I get it. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.10,0:29:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会救那宝宝的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna save that baby, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.60,0:29:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到小卡 阻止黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna find Cass, and we're gonna stop the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.17,0:29:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so what are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.97,0:29:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.32,0:29:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有计划 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a plan, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.60,0:29:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟以前的计划一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the same plan as it's always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.29,0:29:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想出去 就得杀出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to get out, we go through.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.98,0:29:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.35,0:29:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前的计划都是什么结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that been working for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.70,0:29:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们困在医院里可救不了小卡 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't save Cass if we're stuck in some hospital, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.85,0:29:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我没法用时光机回到过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like I can't strap on a time machine, go back,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.87,0:29:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让该隐把血印留着自己玩去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell Cain to shove that mark up his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.74,0:29:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没法阻止你释放黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or stop you from releasing the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.95,0:29:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们犯过错吗 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, have we made mistakes? Yes. Hell, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.84,0:29:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们日后可以挨个分析这些错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can analyze each and every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.65,0:30:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们老掉了牙 喝着冰奶昔\N{\fnArial\fs30}over a couple of frosties when we're old and farting sawdust.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.39,0:30:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且不在这间屋子里的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and out of this room!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.23,0:30:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我能做的就是拿着枪冲出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, all I can do is I can gear up, I can head out,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.08,0:30:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,救下那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can save that freaking baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.45,0:30:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也就要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is exactly what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.12,0:30:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是什么时候忘了该怎么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did we forget how to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.82,0:30:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.67,0:30:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 如果我们现在不改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, if we don't change … right now …
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.16,0:30:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前的所有破事还会继续重演\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of our crap is just gonna keep repeating itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.22,0:30:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听懂 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I-I don't even … what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.68,0:30:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种「先下手后考虑」的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}This … this "kill first, question later."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.39,0:30:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.78,0:30:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,除妖猎魔 我们很擅长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting things … we're good at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.29,0:30:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我们甚至很精通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, we're great at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.27,0:30:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那只是半个标语 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's only half of the bumper sticker, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.42,0:30:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我是想救那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I am trying to save that baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.01,0:30:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那外面的其他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about the others out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.57,0:30:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说那些想杀我们的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the ones trying to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.76,0:30:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说那些病人 那些垂死的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean the ones that are sick, the ones that are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.62,0:30:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那些不传染我们就不会罢休的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, who won't rest until they've infected us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.71,0:30:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就不管找解药了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we just forget about a cure?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.04,0:30:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么解药 珍娜的解药吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What cure? Jenna's cure?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.47,0:30:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,总会有解药的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is always a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.57,0:30:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我们得决心找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have to want to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.95,0:30:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你要是死了还怎么找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, how are you gonna find it if you're dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.66,0:31:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们又回到原点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And around and around we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.07,0:31:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,救人意味着要救所有人 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people means all of the people, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.10,0:31:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是只救一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just that baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.17,0:31:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是只救彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.08,0:31:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我释放了一股能摧毁一切的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I unleashed a force on this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.73,0:31:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这世上 只为了救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could destroy it… To save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.53,0:31:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你别那么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I told you not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.26,0:31:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,重来一次我还是会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.06,0:31:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫不犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a second, I would do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.63,0:31:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我要说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.54,0:31:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的责任 是咱们俩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't on you. It is on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.37,0:31:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.26,0:31:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.30,0:31:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,带珍娜上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Jenna to the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.65,0:31:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她和孩子去个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her and the baby somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.87,0:31:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一枪不发地做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.58,0:31:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且跟着我们的那些东西怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are we gonna do about those things on our tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.17,0:32:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会跟着你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't be on your tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.49,0:32:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.20,0:32:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也说了 迪恩 是我们闯的祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it, Dean. We broke this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.85,0:32:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是我们闯的祸 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we broke this, okay? We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.03,0:32:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应照顾孩子时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard it in your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.42,0:32:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从你的声音里听出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you agreed to take that child.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.31,0:32:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解 你做你该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. You do what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.69,0:32:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也得让我做我该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've got to let me do what I do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.95,0:32:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.57,0:32:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.83,0:33:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抓我啊 你们这些狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get me, you sons of bitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.99,0:34:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么做 让我帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this. Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.39,0:35:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.51,0:35:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.90,0:35:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.65,0:35:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.51,0:35:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会伤害你的 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna hurt you, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.93,0:35:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你不碰那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you leave that baby alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.53,0:35:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.32,0:35:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.44,0:35:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.97,0:35:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.64,0:35:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.32,0:36:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Daddy's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.52,0:36:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.91,0:36:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.66,0:36:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱里有流言\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are rumors from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.26,0:36:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,流言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.30,0:36:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗被释放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The darkness has been released.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.99,0:36:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.35,0:36:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 神话 睡前故事而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Myth. It's a bedtime story.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.50,0:36:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恶魔爸爸吓唬小恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that daddy demons threaten toddler demons with.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.83,0:36:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼他们吃蔬菜的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get them to eat their vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.56,0:36:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是真的 有什么要紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it was true, what's the concern?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.08,0:36:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗 地狱之王 天生盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darkness, king of hell … natural allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.06,0:37:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…发生了点事 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just … something happened, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.08,0:37:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,笼子里有动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.16,0:37:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.50,0:37:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说听起来像是受惊的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, they said it sounded like a frightened animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.64,0:37:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个地狱都听到了 就像是有人发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of hell heard … like someone was going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.36,0:37:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,流言说是米迦勒或路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rumor is that Michael or Lucifer …
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.79,0:37:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们想要警告我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of them is trying to warn us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.15,0:37:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,警惕黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.30,0:37:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.89,0:37:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.81,0:37:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,半个地狱的恶魔都吓坏了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half of hell is sort of freaking out, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.76,0:37:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.16,0:37:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆逃走之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Metatron escaped,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.85,0:37:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们转移了天堂之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}we moved the door to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.94,0:37:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.10,0:37:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了防止再出事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, to prevent further incidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.39,0:37:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我也会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. I would have done the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.53,0:37:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回去前 我们得找个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we go back, we need to find a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.15,0:37:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是其他懂得法术的人移除…\N{\fnArial\fs30}or someone who knows spellcraft to remove the…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.02,0:38:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.87,0:38:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是要带我回天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not taking me to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.42,0:38:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.29,0:38:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.02,0:38:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.28,0:38:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.74,0:38:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,婴儿 便便 能出什么差错呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby. Poop. What could go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.76,0:38:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godspeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.49,0:38:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道自己在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.13,0:38:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.53,0:38:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道情况现在看起来很黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I know things might seem dark right now …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.47,0:38:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说是漆黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, call it pitch-black.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.49,0:38:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能看不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you may not be able to see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.95,0:39:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但回归的路就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your way back is right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.89,0:39:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和她 你们要互相帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and her. You're gonna help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.30,0:39:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出云散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joy comes in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:15.34,Title,0,0,0,0,,我祖母组织了一个《圣经》研习小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandma leads a bible study.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.43,0:39:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.53,0:39:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.60,0:39:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 在镇外40英里处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, about 40 miles outside of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.90,0:39:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前看来 这里十分荒僻\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I can tell, it's isolated to superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.47,0:39:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.33,0:39:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.06,0:39:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.06,0:39:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样我都会找到解药的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it or not, I'm gonna find a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.67,0:39:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.56,0:40:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在情况好糟糕啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, things are screwy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.29,0:40:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们没有任何答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we don't have any answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.33,0:40:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但至少我们拿下了一局 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but at least we got one win, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.07,0:40:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.14,0:40:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我要送珍娜去她祖母家\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm gonna run Jenna up to her grandmother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.69,0:40:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该只要几小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't be more than a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.14,0:40:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们清理那个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we clean up that town.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.93,0:40:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到黑暗 收拾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find the darkness, and we kick her ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.27,0:40:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 很好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's great, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.45,0:40:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来是个好计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}That…sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.44,0:40:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真像人说的那样坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're as bad as they say you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.64,0:40:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么还不伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}why haven't you hurt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.21,0:40:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你永远不会伤害我的理由是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the same reason that you'll never hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.65,0:40:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是联系在一起的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bound, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.20,0:40:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会永远联系在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll always be bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.93,0:40:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮助过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.06,0:40:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也帮助了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I helped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.36,0:40:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我在哪里 我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter where I am, who I am…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.32,0:40:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远都会帮助彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will always help each other.
